- Translation: generated by c2das, https://github.com/lookibed/c2das, at commit
  @C2DAS_COMMIT@ (scripts/export_dasquake.py).
- The c2das-authored harness files, the C sources in harness/ (engine_config.h,
  qg_platform.c, quake_entry.c, qg_eden.h, qg_eden_play.c), their translations,
  and the hand-written EdenSpark host eden/c2das_quake_player.das are part of
  this GPL work and are distributed under the same licence.

Game data
---------

The Quake game data (id1/pak0.pak) is NOT included and is not covered by the
GPL. It is id Software's shareware release (Quake 1.06, episode 1), licensed
under that release's SLICNSE.TXT ("SHAREWARE VERSION: QUAKE, LIMITED USE
SOFTWARE LICENSE AGREEMENT"):

- the end user may distribute the Software only as a whole and free of charge;
- the licence is for non-commercial use: commercially exploiting the Software
  or any portion of it is forbidden.

Distributing pak0.pak on its own would distribute a portion of the release
outside its whole, so this repository does not. tools/get_pak.sh downloads the
whole shareware release from a mirror of id Software's FTP site and extracts
the pak locally. The registered (full) game data is commercial software and
must never be committed or distributed with this repository.
